## User Flows

### Flow 1: Log a New Book

```
Shelf screen
    → Tap "Log a book"
        → Search by title or author
            → Select book (pulls cover, metadata from book API)
                → Rate it (stars or equivalent)
                    → Enter Quick Take flow (3 prompts)
                        → Card generated
                            → Card appears on shelf
```

### Flow 2: View Your Shelf

```
Open Afterword
    → See your shelf (all logged books with cards)
        → Tap any book
            → See full card (your take, rating, metadata)
                → Option to share
                → Option to "Go Deeper" (future: additional prompts)
```

### Flow 3: Share a Card

```
Viewing a card
    → Tap "Share"
        → Copy as image / Copy link / Download
            → Share to WhatsApp, Twitter, Instagram, etc.
```

