## What We Are NOT Building (MVP)

| Feature | Why Not |
|---------|---------|
| Social feed | Cold start problem. Empty rooms kill products. |
| Comments / replies | No users to comment. Cards travel on existing networks. |
| Book recommendations | Not the job. Goodreads, friends, and bookstores do this. |
| Reading progress tracking | Not the job. This is post-book, not during-book. |
| Goodreads import | Nice-to-have, not essential. Manual logging is fine for MVP. |
| Discussion forum | Future layer, only once enough cards exist per book. |
| "Your take vs. consensus" | Future layer. Requires aggregated data from multiple users. |
| Go Deeper (extended prompts) | Future layer. Start with 3, prove the core loop works. |

